  "prefLabel": "Liq 1001.01 Proof of Age",
  "priorExpiration": "2006-01-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 1001.01 Proof of Age. No sampler, as defined in RSA 126-K:2,IX, shall provide any tobacco products, e-cigarettes, or liquid nicotine to any person without confirming that person’s age under the provisions of RSA 126-K:3.\n\nSource. #6668, eff 1-1-98, EXPIRED: 1-1-06\n\nNew. #12082, eff 1-6-17",
